OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA few bright or sunny intervals
OL,6,Fthrough the day although rather cloudy
OL,7,Fat times. A few brief light showers
OL,8,Fthis morning before it becomes largely
OL,9,Fdry this afternoon. Fresh to strong
OL,10,Fnorthwesterly winds, easing by
OL,11,Fafternoon.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FThis evening will be mainly
OL,14,Fdry with just the odd passing light
OL,15,Fshower. Then the rest of the night
OL,16,Fwill be cloudy with spells of rain
OL,17,Fspreading from the west.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
