OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FCloudy with rain at times,
OL,6,Falthough Shetland may turn drier and
OL,7,Fsomewhat drier for a time in the
OL,8,Fafternoon. Fresh southwesterly winds.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FCloudy
OL,11,Fand breezy with rain at times on
OL,12,FSaturday. Brighter on Sunday with just
OL,13,Fthe odd shower. Dry on Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
